Bundled data and fonts:

  The `psl` crate compiles a snapshot of the Public Suffix List
  (https://publicsuffix.org/), which is published by Mozilla under the
  Mozilla Public License 2.0. The list is used unmodified as data; the
  snapshot version is recorded in every manifest that uses it.

  The desktop application embeds the fonts shipped with egui: Hack (MIT),
  Ubuntu (Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0), Noto Emoji (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  and emoji-icon-font (MIT).

  No GeoIP / ASN database is bundled. MaxMind GeoLite2 and similar
  databases are subject to their own licences and must be obtained and
  imported by the user.
